        <h1>Does Intermittent or Continuous Artificial Gravity Counteract Long Duration Bed Rest Induced Neurocognitive Declines?</h1>
        <div class="meta-id">Record ID: 80NSSC18K0783</div>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <div class="action-banner">
